@startuml MagicLinkSSO-Overview

title Magic Link SSO

top to bottom direction

actor User
rectangle "Magic Link SSO\nVerified email identity" as SSO
rectangle "Email inbox" as Email
rectangle "Application A\nOwn application session" as AppA
rectangle "Application B\nOwn application session" as AppB

User --> SSO : Sign in to an application
SSO -right-> Email : First sign-in:\nmagic link or optional code
SSO --> AppA : Verified sign-in
SSO --> AppB : Optional shared browser sign-in:\nreuse identity without another email

note bottom of AppA
Each application uses a framework
integration or Magic Link SSO Gate.
end note

note bottom of AppB
Shared browser sign-in is opt-in.
Each application checks its own access rules.
end note

@enduml
